  "question": "Which restaurant fall within 70 kilometers when heading from Debbie Doolittle's Petting Zoo, Tacoma, WA toward the Vintage Antique Motorcycle Museum, Chehalis, WA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.432984 47.131086)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.970847 46.665552)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.432984 47.131086)',4326)::geography, 70000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.432984 47.131086)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
